#. ねぇねぇ、出口見つかった？
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Hey! Didja find a way outta here!?"
msgstr ""

#. こっちは全然だよ。収穫ゼロ。
#. あー、弱った、弱った。
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I didn't find a thing. Nothin', zippo, zilch. Lost all\n"
"my motivation..."
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に過ごす
msgctxt "0003 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Spend some time with Hina"
msgstr ""

#. 他の場所へ行く
msgctxt "0004 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Go see who else is around"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうしよう？
#. 朝日奈さんを誘ってみようか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Should I talk to Hina for a while?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、一緒に休憩でもしよっか？
#. 出口探し回ってたから、喉が乾いちゃったよ。
msgctxt "0006 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Let's take a little break together! I'm super thirsty\n"
"from all that runnin' around."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんと一緒に、
#. 食堂でお茶を飲んで過ごした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina and I went to the dining hall to get a drink...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Hina a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
